<title>UK: British Steel buys back 93.234 mln shares.</title>
<headline>British Steel buys back 93.234 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Steel Plc said on Thursday it had bought for cancellation 93.234 million ordinary shares at 155p per share.</p>
<p>The company said earlier on Thursday it planned to buy back up to five percent of its shares after shareholders granted authority to repurchase up to 10 percent of its capital.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
